==English==

===Etymology===
[[remarkable]] + [[-ly]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-remarkably.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# {{context|manner}} In a [[remarkable]] manner.
#: ''He performed the piece '''remarkably''', offering novel interpretations to its nearly cliched passages.''
# {{context|degree}} To a [[noteworthy]] extent.
#: ''That dog is '''remarkably''' fierce.''
# {{context|evaluative}} {{non-gloss definition|Used to draw special attention to a proposition}}.
#: '''''Remarkably''', three State assembly elections were decided by a total of fewer than one hundred votes.''

